        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Blue Ridge Music Center, Blue Ridge Parkway, Galax, Virginia, North Carolina\n- Organizations: Shenandoah National Park, Great Smoky Mountains National Park\n- Topics: music venues, museums, visitor centers, linear parks\n\nFacts:\n- The Blue Ridge Music Center is a music venue, museum, and visitor center at milepost 213 on the Blue Ridge Parkway near Galax, Virginia.\n- The Blue Ridge Parkway is America's longest linear park.\n- The Blue Ridge Parkway runs for 469 miles through 29 counties in Virginia and North Carolina.\n- The Blue Ridge Parkway links Shenandoah National Park to Great Smoky Mountains National Park.",
